---
module: checkins
func_id: submit-check-in
---

***conformance tests***

# t10-magic-link
T10: a check-in can be completed through the magic link without login in at most 5 steps.

# t15-required-fields
T15: submitting without required fields is impossible; a draft is saved and a reminder returns the patient to it.

# t16-red-flag-check-in
T16: a red flag in a check-in shows "Kontaktirajte zdravnika" immediately and creates a RED Alert on submission.

# fever-red
After `POST /sim/advance` with 1440 minutes, a final check-in with the token of `pat-09`, `wellbeing` 4, `pain` 1, `symptoms` [] and `temperatureC` 38.7 returns `201` with `assessment.status` `RED`, `reassuranceAllowed` `false`, `alertCreated` `true` and no `reassuranceText`.

# stable-green
After `POST /sim/advance` with 1440 minutes, a final check-in with the token of `pat-10`, `wellbeing` 5, `pain` 0, `symptoms` [] and `temperatureC` 36.8 returns `201` with `assessment.status` `GREEN`, `reassuranceAllowed` `true` and `reassuranceText` "v okviru pričakovanega za ta dan".

# one-final-per-slot
After `POST /sim/advance` with 1440 minutes, a final check-in with the token of `pat-03` returns `201`; the same check-in sent again right after returns `409` with `already_submitted`, and `GET /patients/pat-03/checkins` has one :CheckIn: more than before the first.

# first-check-in-without-trend
After `POST /sim/advance` with 1440 minutes, a final check-in with the token of `pat-04` with only `wellbeing` 4, `pain` 3 and `symptoms` [] returns `201`.
